  "question": {
    "text": "For the reaction <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>⇌</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> at equilibrium, the concentration of A is <math><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> B is 0.15 M and C is 0.05 M. The <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>°</mo></math> for the hydrolysis of A at 300 K is <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math> kJ/mole. The value of X is?<br />\rReport your answer by rounding it upto nearest integer.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "As <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>⇌</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mfenced></mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.15</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>°</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2.303</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2.303</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8.314</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>300</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br />On solving <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>°</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4.99</mn></math> kJ/M<br /><math><mo>≃</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math> kJ/M<br />So <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>",
